[34213] = {id=34213,name="They Have My Son",level=40,requiredLevel=40,faction="alliance",expansion=5,description="Please, $p! Can you help me. I received a ransom note from a very corrupt and uncouth orc within the ranks of the Iron Horde. He has my son! He made sure to include a number of graphic words to describe what would happen if the ransom is not paid. Clearly he thinks my people conjure gold from the nether. And if I try to rescue him myself, both of us will be killed in the process. Can you go to Gron'mar for me and rescue my son? His name is Corki .",questType="standard"},
